1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Thank you!

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,300
血潮に乗ってその身に纏ったクラウン

6
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:07,380
空になく全てを振り払うように

7
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:19,380
叶えよう約束通り 君は出た世界だ

8
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:23,980
Let's start this world, even I cannot drop this world

9
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:28,940
All I need is getting strong, we can catch the game

10
00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:33,560
負けないでよ 目に厚させてよ

11
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:39,820
ほら 見方に変えてよ We can kiss the game

12
00:01:39,820 --> 00:01:49,720
揺れしだすよ その通り その影は見ないでよ We can kiss the game

13
00:01:58,940 --> 00:02:04,560
What? But you... I mean... You're... How? Why? What? I'm so confused

14
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,560
Did you not hear me?

15
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:08,180
What's happening? Nero's a bird and birds don't talk

16
00:02:08,180 --> 00:02:10,180
So how in the heck are you talking to me right now?

17
00:02:10,180 --> 00:02:11,720
The bird just spoke

18
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:14,380
It must be a spirit! A noble spirit!

19
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:18,420
Nero! What's going on here? Since when have you been a talker?

20
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:21,080
Wait, I know! I'm still asleep, aren't I?

21
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:23,580
Kindly pick your jaw up off the ground

22
00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:25,300
I need a portal at once

23
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:29,300
Not only is the bird talking, now it's giving me orders too?

24
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:35,460
As it stands, the humans who are still possessed by elves may not be able to change back

25
00:02:35,460 --> 00:02:35,720
Huh?

26
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:37,420
That's not the worst part

27
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:42,000
Anyway, I need you to escort me to the demon's bones immediately

28
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,540
Wow, weird day

29
00:02:44,540 --> 00:02:56,760
Now we turn

30
00:02:56,760 --> 00:03:02,800
One good cop deserves another

31
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:05,840
Tempest of Blades!

32
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:09,600
You ever heard of a fair fight, pal?

33
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:14,060
This devil's got some dirty tricks

34
00:03:14,060 --> 00:03:19,080
Not only can he make anything he says manifest as magic

35
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:24,840
He can summon objects, move them, and manipulate them however he sees fit

36
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:30,020
That Tempest of Blades technique is pretty much all those things at once

37
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:32,000
This is ridiculous

38
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:39,220
He withered Charlotte's briars, healed himself, and messes with us in every other way he can think of

39
00:03:39,220 --> 00:03:46,020
But since he hasn't straight up ordered us to die, that must mean he has some limitations

40
00:03:46,020 --> 00:03:49,460
Damn it, this is such a pain in the ass

41
00:03:49,460 --> 00:03:51,560
Charlotte!

42
00:03:52,340 --> 00:03:53,340
It's Sharla!

43
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:58,580
Earlier

44
00:03:58,580 --> 00:04:00,660
With our fights!

45
00:04:01,100 --> 00:04:03,860
Not all of my briars were affected by his attack

46
00:04:03,860 --> 00:04:05,760
Perhaps they were out of range?

47
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:12,280
His magic capacity might have been a factor as well

48
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:16,760
Could it be that he's putting such a massive amount of magic power into his words

49
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:19,520
That our own spells are being overwhelmed?

50
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:28,640
All we can do is weather his attacks while we try to figure out what his weakness is

51
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:33,880
I did notice one thing though

52
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:37,760
No matter what he says, his words can't block my dark magic

53
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:40,420
Yep, he jumped out of the way

54
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:43,000
Now I just gotta land a good hit on him

55
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:52,320
Not too bad

56
00:04:52,320 --> 00:05:00,640
For someone who's essentially still asleep, you seem to be moving around quite a bit

57
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:02,060
He's right

58
00:05:02,060 --> 00:05:04,420
He's right, Licht can't use his full power yet

59
00:05:04,420 --> 00:05:06,820
For now, the fight appears balanced

60
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:07,820
But soon

61
00:05:07,820 --> 00:05:10,200
Tempest of rage

62
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:17,240
There's no end of these damn things

63
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:19,960
Man, this freak is even stronger than I thought

64
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:24,320
In terms of raw power, he's got us all beat

65
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:27,940
I can't keep my magic going forever

66
00:05:27,940 --> 00:05:31,040
And he looks like he hasn't even broken a sweat

67
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:37,400
I'm enjoying your company

68
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:39,900
It's good to have something to keep me busy

69
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:45,800
Inhabiting my own body and playing freely with my magic spells is enough to make my heart dance with happiness

70
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,900
I'm very grateful to you

71
00:05:47,900 --> 00:05:50,840
And of course, you helped me obtain the five-leaf grimoire

72
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:51,920
Let's try it

73
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,920
I'll show you what devils are truly capable of

74
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,920
Word's all magic

75
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,920
Just when I think I've seen his worst move

76
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,920
He's got more

77
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,920
I am a being from another dimension

78
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:19,920
The likes of which you cannot begin to fathom

79
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:21,920
You're doomed

80
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,920
You're doomed

81
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,920
What the hell is happening?

82
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,920
Magic

83
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,920
Is it from the world of the dead?

84
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:47,920
Cut them off and they grow right back

85
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,920
Cut them off and they grow right back

86
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:53,920
Yep, we're screwed

87
00:06:53,920 --> 00:07:04,920
What is that?

88
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:05,920
No idea

89
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:10,920
Even with spatial magic that was a long trip

90
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:11,920
Don't waste time

91
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:14,920
Okay, okay, I got it stupid bird

92
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:19,920
Take out the magic stones embedded within this monument

93
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:25,920
Hey, all the magic stones that were stolen by the eye of the midnight sun are inside this thing

94
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,920
Are you sure I can do that?

95
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,920
Make it quick

96
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,920
Make it quick

97
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:32,920
Now, place the stones into the statue

98
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,920
It's the first wizard king

99
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:34,920
Here goes

100
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:35,920
And now the eyes

101
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,920
Almost done

102
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,720
Place the stones into the statue.

103
00:07:41,860 --> 00:07:43,320
It's the first wizard king.

104
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,600
Here goes.

105
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,180
And now the eyes.

106
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:56,920
Almost done.

107
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,200
No way!

108
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:04,680
What's happening?

109
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,920
Watch out!

110
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,920
Oh no!

111
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,920
What's wrong with our spells?

112
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,920
They're melting!

113
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,920
Dark cloaked! Black blade! Blood flash!

114
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,920
That monster!

115
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:30,920
This train of my magic and my physical strength!

116
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:35,920
Soon you'll be too weak to carry your sword!

117
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:40,920
I've just initiated a devastating spell that depletes the life force from all the touches!

118
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:43,920
And once it starts, there's no way to stop it!

119
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:48,920
Eventually, it'll devour all of existence!

120
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:54,920
Damn! This keeps getting more hopeless!

121
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:00,920
There's something coming toward us!

122
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:02,920
What is that stuff?

123
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:04,920
What is that stuff?

124
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:06,920
The devil's power!

125
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,920
Light magic! Light swords of conviction!

126
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:13,920
Wind magic! Tornado fan!

127
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,920
It's absorbing all of our spells!

128
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,920
It's not stopping! Stay back!

129
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:29,920
Gotcha!

130
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:32,920
Hasta!

131
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:35,920
Hasta!

132
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:42,920
I thought that would've killed me for sure!

133
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,920
Oh, thank goodness!

134
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,920
Anti-magic works against that too?

135
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,920
And he isn't even injured!

136
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:55,920
Guess it didn't feel like swallowing a loser with no magic!

137
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:57,920
This is so bizarre!

138
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:58,920
We are!

139
00:09:58,920 --> 00:10:00,920
I'm fine, by the way! Thanks a lot!

140
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:02,920
Oh no!

141
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:04,920
I knew it!

142
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:07,920
There's even more of that eerie magic power hovering above us right now!

143
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,920
Which means the people in the other rooms are in danger too!

144
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:16,920
If anyone has the swiftness to get the possessed magic knights out,

145
00:10:17,920 --> 00:10:21,920
we have to protect the Clover Kingdom from this threat without abandoning any of our own.

146
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:24,920
I'll go and assist everyone in the lower rooms.

147
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:26,920
You'd better come with me, Vermillion.

148
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:28,920
Yes, sir.

149
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:31,920
You three seem to understand the enemy and what's going on above more than I do.

150
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:36,920
If you can find a way to use Asta's anti-magic, Yuno's spirit magic,

151
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:39,920
and the elf's light magic in tandem with one another,

152
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:41,920
you should make it to the main chamber.

153
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:43,920
Get moving!

154
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:45,920
Right!

155
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,920
Now that your seal has finally been broken,

156
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:00,920
I'm assuming my own seal will be released as well.

157
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:02,920
Huh? Miro...

158
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:05,920
What a pathetic state you're in.

159
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:08,920
If only my spell had worked more completely.

160
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:11,920
No. Without your help, I couldn't return at all.

161
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:13,920
Huh?

162
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,920
It's good to see you again, my prince.

163
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:22,920
At long last.

164
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:26,920
You're the first Wizard King!

165
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:29,920
That statue! It was you the whole time?

166
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:31,920
And how did Nero...

167
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:34,920
No way! Nero, is that really you?

168
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:36,920
You look, um, kinda different!

169
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:39,920
Hello!

170
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,920
If I had known you were secretly a gorgeous young lady,

171
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:43,920
I would have asked you on a date forever ago!

172
00:11:43,920 --> 00:11:45,920
But hey, there's no time like the present, right?

173
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:48,920
Yep, cool, got it.

174
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:53,920
I sense an otherworldly magic emanating from the Shadow Palace.

175
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:57,920
I see. He must have obtained a new body then.

176
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:00,920
Back to you guys! How'd you get here?

177
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:05,920
Long ago, she used her sealing magic to confine me within the statue when I was close to death.

178
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:07,920
So I've been sleeping.

179
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:15,920
Then tonight, with the help of the magic stones, I was able to return at least partially.

180
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:21,920
His mana's so calm, yet so powerful. It's even stronger than elf magic!

181
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:23,920
As for her...

182
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:27,920
The truth is, I spent five centuries living as a bird.

183
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:30,920
Uh, why are you holding my hand?

184
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,920
Sealing magic! Inverse release!

185
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:42,920
Sealing magic!

186
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:45,920
Huh?

187
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:48,920
Now then, wait for your friends!

188
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:50,920
And thank you for setting me free!

189
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:52,920
Ahhhh!

190
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:59,920
You've been waiting for five hundred years. I'm so sorry.

191
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:01,920
No.

192
00:13:04,920 --> 00:13:08,920
The most important thing is that we make sure history doesn't repeat itself.

193
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:27,920
As a noble, I should have been a powerful mage, but my magic was only good for opening and closing things, so others looked on it with contempt.

194
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:33,920
And I was assigned to serve an eccentric prince, whose magic was amazing even for royalty.

195
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:36,920
He's probably a snob.

196
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:40,920
Why, hello there! You must be Sekre, right?

197
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:45,920
I'm sorry. I would have come to you, but I've been so buried in my research lately.

198
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,920
Tell me, what's your magic like?

199
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,920
But he wasn't what I imagined at all.

200
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:53,920
Sealing magic?

201
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:58,920
I've never heard of that before! It must be rare! You're so lucky!

202
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:02,920
How can we put it to use? Thinking about it is so exciting!

203
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:07,920
All it does is open and close locks. It's shameful.

204
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:11,920
Hey, don't say that! You're sealing yourself off from the possibilities.

205
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:13,920
I hope you don't think you just said something clever.

206
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:15,920
Aww.

207
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:17,920
Also, your clothes are strange.

208
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:20,920
What? But I made them myself. You don't like them?

209
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:22,920
More importantly…

210
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:24,920
Don't change the subject.

211
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:27,920
What is it you need? I'm supposed to be your servant, after all.

212
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:29,920
Hmm, good question.

213
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:32,920
Right now, I'm trying to make some magical tools.

214
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:34,920
Magical tools?

215
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:39,920
That's right. With these, even someone born without any magic can use all kinds of spells.

216
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,920
I think it'll be a good way to make our society more equal in the future.

217
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:45,920
Equal? You're dreaming.

218
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:56,920
It can be done, with the help of my magic items. I'm sure your ability will be a huge help in making them. I know. Can you seal magic into objects?

219
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:58,920
Um, yes.

220
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:00,920
Wow, really? That's perfect!

221
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:06,920
And so, I helped the Prince with his magical inventions.

222
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:20,920
I'd never met anyone else like him in my whole life. There were some members of his family who resented him, because of the progressive ideas that he championed.

223
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:29,920
But he didn't let that bother him. He remained strong and honest, never compromising his beliefs.

224
00:15:29,920 --> 00:15:45,920
I've noticed that he and his sister, Lady Tetya, have been sneaking out of the castle quite a lot recently. What could they be doing here?

225
00:15:45,920 --> 00:16:05,920
Huh? They're meeting with a group of elves? Phenomenal magic talent. Similar ideals. The same four-leaf grimoires. For the first time, the Prince had found a pier and licked the leader of the elves.

226
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:23,920
Let's foster understanding. Your elvish mana really is a remarkable thing. If we combine that with our own magic item technology, this land will be safer and more prosperous. Let's all work together, hand in hand.

227
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:46,920
His items stored and distributed magic, and their magic stones amplified spells by linking to another world. By combining his work with the elves' resources, the Prince developed magic item technology ever further, and the world he dreamed of where both races could live in harmony was becoming a reality.

228
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:53,920
He and Licked were best friends, and soon they would become family as well.

229
00:16:53,920 --> 00:17:11,920
I'm sorry, Tetya, but it looks like I might have to arrive late to your wedding. Father has summoned me to the palace that day, and I can't refuse. I know you're disappointed that he and the others don't approve of this, but please, don't worry. I'm sure they'll come to understand someday.

230
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:18,920
Yes, and it's all right. Even if you're late to the ceremony, Licked and his family will be so pleased to see you there.

231
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:26,920
But, it's likely that even then, his plot was already in motion.

232
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:38,920
Why did Father call me here? We didn't mention the wedding to anyone, so it must be coincidence. I should hurry or I'll miss it. Where is he?

233
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:41,920
I'm here, Father. You wanted to speak with me?

234
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:43,920
Now, bye!

235
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:49,920
What's this? I'm trapped!

236
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:53,920
Good day, my prince!

237
00:17:53,920 --> 00:18:00,920
Minister? No, that villainous mana doesn't belong to him. Who are you?

238
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:11,920
Who, me? Despair? Hatred? Disloyalty? Death? Any number of awful things, really. Use whatever name you prefer.

239
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:20,920
I've read about this being. A soul from the other world with evil mana. A devil. Where's my family?

240
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:28,920
Who knows? Perhaps they've gone to confront that other race that's plotting to use your unwitting princess to topple this entire kingdom, but that's only a guess.

241
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:38,920
Imagine how surprised the elves will be when a monster's act of human violence befalls that little wedding ceremony that only you were supposed to know was happening.

242
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:41,920
No! Let go! No!

243
00:18:41,920 --> 00:19:00,920
What an impressive spell. That's why they call you the best. Unfortunately, I was prepared for that, so even you won't escape from those bonds so easily. As soon as I obtain my body and grimoire, I promise I'll come back to play with you again.

244
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:10,920
Wait! Help me! Isn't anyone here? Please! Prince! Thank goodness!

